sequenceDiagram
    actor Browser
    participant ALB as ALB
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant GR as Guardrail Router
    participant LG as LangGraph Agent
    participant PG as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant vLLM as vLLM / LLM Provider
    participant LF as Langfuse

    Note over Browser,LF: ── Flow 1: Page Load (SSR) ──
    Browser->>+ALB: GET https://a20-app-049.io.vn/
    ALB->>+FE: route → frontend target
    FE->>+BE: GET /api/courses (server-side via API_INTERNAL_URL)
    BE->>+PG: SELECT courses, learning_units WHERE active=true
    PG-->>-BE: course catalog
    BE-->>-FE: JSON courses
    FE-->>-ALB: rendered HTML
    ALB-->>-Browser: page

    Note over Browser,LF: ── Flow 2: AI Tutor Chat (Agentic RAG + SSE) ──
    Browser->>+BE: POST /api/agent/message {thread_id, message, unit_id}
    Note over BE: PII Sanitizer (input)
    BE->>+GR: classify(message, kp_scope)
    Note over GR: Qwen3.5-0.8B LoRA inference
    GR-->>-BE: {safety:SAFE, topic:ON_TOPIC, action:ALLOW}
    Note over BE: Smart Router → COMPLEX
    BE->>+LG: invoke_graph(thread_id, message)
    LG->>+PG: load thread state + vector_search(query_embedding)
    PG-->>-LG: conversation history + top-k chunks
    Note over LG: Rerank → Answer Node → evidence_policy
    LG->>+vLLM: generate(evidence, question) streaming
    vLLM-->>-LG: token stream
    LG-->>-BE: streamed response
    LG->>PG: save thread state (agent_graph_runs)
    Note over BE: PII Sanitizer (output)
    BE-->>-Browser: SSE stream text/event-stream
    BE--)LF: trace_span(input, output, guardrail, latency)

    Note over Browser,LF: ── Flow 3: Assessment Submit + Mastery Update ──
    Browser->>+BE: POST /api/assessment/submit {session_id, answers}
    BE->>+PG: SELECT item_calibration WHERE canonical_item_id IN (?)
    PG-->>-BE: IRT params (discrimination, difficulty, guessing)
    Note over BE: 2PL-lite scoring: delta = observed - predicted_probability
    BE->>PG: UPSERT learner_mastery_kp (theta_mu, theta_sigma)
    BE->>PG: INSERT interactions + learning_session_events
    Note over BE: recommendation_engine.recompute() — prerequisite-aware
    BE-->>-Browser: {score, feedback, next_units, mastery_by_kp}
